title: "@three-ws/glb-diff"
abstract: "Structural diff for glTF/GLB. Tells you what actually changed between two 3D models: geometry, materials, textures, skeletons, animations, with git-style rename and move detection. Isomorphic library plus a CI-ready CLI."
